<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="5523ddf9-fa49-4262-b586-172581f8f573" version="2">
  <Properties>
    <Name>(n) Religious Victory</Name>
    <Stability>Alpha</Stability>
    <Teaser>Adds Religious Victory</Teaser>
    <Description>[COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Religious Victory[ENDCOLOR]
[NEWLINE]
[NEWLINE]Establish: You must own an Enhanced Religion.
[NEWLINE]Spread: Your religion must be dominant in 100% of the cities on the map. Threshold reduced by 2% for every Era that passes and by 3% for every Holy Site you construct.
[NEWLINE]Sage: While your religion is dominant, buy the Sage unit in your Capital. Defend them for the 20 turns it takes to complete their meditation, and you win.
[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]
[COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Credits[ENDCOLOR]
[NEWLINE]Thanks to Pdan and Jarcast for helpful discussions.
[NEWLINE]Sage model and skin from Fantasy Army by S-Man
[NEWLINE]
[NEWLINE]Based on the Extra Victory Conditions mod by Barbarian King (aka Stephen)
[NEWLINE]Victory symbols by averysillyman
[NEWLINE]Special Thanks to whoward69 for his great tutorials on UI editing</Description>
    <Authors>Hokath</Authors>
